  "contentHtml": "<p>&lt;재미있는&nbsp;과학수업&nbsp;만들기&gt;의&nbsp;수업관련자료들은&nbsp;선생님들의&nbsp;'협업'을&nbsp;위해&nbsp;공유되고&nbsp;있습니다.&nbsp;<br>수업을&nbsp;위한&nbsp;자료로만&nbsp;사용해주시기&nbsp;바랍니다.&nbsp;<br>**&nbsp;'말머리'&nbsp;에서&nbsp;해당단원을&nbsp;선택해주세요.&nbsp;수업자료를&nbsp;찾기&nbsp;쉬워집니다.**<br><br>안녕하세요,&nbsp;첫&nbsp;글이라&nbsp;떨리네요..&nbsp;이런&nbsp;것도&nbsp;도움이&nbsp;될런지&nbsp;모르겠어요.<br>정전기&nbsp;관련&nbsp;코난&nbsp;영상을&nbsp;찾게&nbsp;되었는데&nbsp;에피소드가&nbsp;2개고&nbsp;길어서..<br>필요없는&nbsp;부분은&nbsp;잘라내고&nbsp;편집한&nbsp;영상입니다.<br>학습지도&nbsp;만들어&nbsp;보았는데&nbsp;영상이&nbsp;길어서...&nbsp;ppt로&nbsp;다같이&nbsp;풀까도&nbsp;생각중입니다.<br>편집한&nbsp;영상은&nbsp;35분정도&nbsp;됩니다.&nbsp;(일본어&nbsp;버전입니다.)<br><br></p><p><iframe id=\"va269eIITeBBrq2Xhqy9yJh\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/va269eIITeBBrq2Xhqy9yJh?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZhMjY5ZUlJVGVCQnJxMlhocXk5eUpoIiwidGlkIjoiNjFkYjg1MGQtNTg5Yy00MGZmLTkzNTgtMDc4ODc2NzYwZDMzIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTgxOTg3fQ.xtILdpRpFHdX8oOze1LTNobjATU09dVUxVnnAyANs_t8hZTDqgWSRqgpIN0bSI3YVWH4FADgO2MbTm8k_j-Riw&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><br><br><br><br><br>&lt;학습지&nbsp;정답&gt;<br><br>1.&nbsp;정전기<br>2.&nbsp;(1)&nbsp;클래식&nbsp;&nbsp;(3)&nbsp;휘발유&nbsp;&nbsp;(4)&nbsp;스웨터<br>3.&nbsp;(1)&nbsp;정전기&nbsp;방지&nbsp;&nbsp;(2)&nbsp;지붕&nbsp;&nbsp;(3)&nbsp;지면&nbsp;&nbsp;(4)&nbsp;보<br><br><br><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
